e_Cannith\" title=\"House Cannith\">House Cannith</a> symbol is patterned in teal and brown.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></li>\n<li>Introduced with the celebration of the <a href=\"/page/13th_Anniversary\" title=\"13th Anniversary\">13th Anniversary</a> (February 2019). See: <a href=\"/page/Item:Thirteen_Year_Old_Cake\" title=\"Item:Thirteen Year Old Cake\">Thirteen Year Old Cake</a>.</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816232540\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.065 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.109 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3120/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 18445/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4109/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 32/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 15/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n136.70%  127.564     36 Template:IO\n100.00%   93.319      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%   93.319      1 -total\n 96.94%   90.462      1 Template:Named_Clothing\n 45.94%   42.873      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 45.09%   42.073      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 44.15%   41.198      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 43.20%   40.318      2 Template:InCategory\n 17.91%   16.709      1 Template:Mat\n 16.21%   15.126      2 Template:Popup\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:73193-0!canonical and timestamp 20260816232540 and revision id 631472. Rendering was trig